     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello,<div><br></div><div>An example (where the error is reproducible) input would be:</div><div><br></div><div><div>NC_007070.3 860 + CG 0.200 10</div><div>NC_007070.3 909 + CG 0.091 11</div><div>NC_007070.3 2591 + CG 0.333 6</div><div>NC_007070.3 2654 + CG 0.143 7</div><div>NC_007070.3 4082 - CG 0.077 13</div><div>NC_007070.3 4144 - CG 0.091 11</div><div>NC_007070.3 8868 + CG 0.067 15</div><div>NC_007070.3 8939 + CG 0.083 12</div><div>NC_007070.3 11930 - CG 0.167 6</div><div>NC_007070.3 15964 - CG 0.100 10</div><div><br></div><div>where col 1 is Chr, 2 is location, 3 is strand, 4 is context, 5 is ratio and 6 is total sites.  </div><div><br></div><div>Or to download the file: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0Bx7gmgQsibuPaHEwaXNLaGdELWs/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://drive.google.com/file/d/0Bx7gmgQsibuPaHEwaXNLaGdELWs/view?usp%3Dsharing&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793232441782000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1ELzrkHMHG903ITZMQWbC9\">Download_BSMap_sample_file</a><br></div><div><br></div><div>The input is:</div><div><div>Test=methRead(&quot;testBSmap&quot;,<a href=\"http://sample.id\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://sample.id&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793232441782000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3EDDYljlX_gKxcuTMPBnA_\">sample.id</a>=&quot;test&quot;,assembly=&quot;45&quot;, header=FALSE, context=&quot;CpG&quot;, resolution=&quot;base&quot;,pipeline=list(fraction=TRUE, chr.col=1, start.col=2,end.col=2,coverage.col=6,strand.col=3,freqC.col=5))</div></div><div><br></div><div> and the output I get is: </div></div></div>"
